Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Hemodinamia", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.980523001640232*^9, 3.980523018829979*^9}, {
  3.9805230626503334`*^9, 
  3.980523065413496*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"24777479-e083-6e4f-9121-\
e82bcd6abc94"],

Cell["\<\
La hemodinamia es la rama de la medicina y la biof\[IAcute]sica que se \
encarga del estudio del flujo sangu\[IAcute]neo y su din\[AAcute]mica dentro \
del sistema cardiovascular (arterias, venas y el coraz\[OAcute]n). Permite \
evaluar c\[OAcute]mo interact\[UAcute]an el coraz\[OAcute]n y los vasos sangu\
\[IAcute]neos para determinar el estado de la circulaci\[OAcute]n del \
paciente. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.959783579750093*^9, 3.9597839729425364`*^9}, 
   3.960461468886182*^9, {3.960461593777936*^9, 3.960461725404254*^9}, {
   3.9637921756500626`*^9, 3.963792177301405*^9}, {3.963792334972908*^9, 
   3.9637924264005146`*^9}, 3.9690120237401333`*^9, {3.969013411916519*^9, 
   3.9690134747870903`*^9}, {3.9690136254052734`*^9, 
   3.9690136569807568`*^9}, {3.9690137461749077`*^9, 3.969013789139765*^9}, {
   3.969013838821596*^9, 3.969013869288269*^9}, {3.9690139401519527`*^9, 
   3.9690139412866344`*^9}, {3.969013977678911*^9, 3.969014013216446*^9}, {
   3.969014131230032*^9, 3.9690142038114567`*^9}, {3.972243895500122*^9, 
   3.9722438966996117`*^9}, {3.9722445307530384`*^9, 3.972244596118904*^9}, {
   3.972244866312065*^9, 3.9722448681129*^9}, {3.9805230930599976`*^9, 
   3.9805231249915047`*^9}},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.87, 0.94, 1],ExpressionUUID->"fb22d7a7-e714-de43-93c4-86939b2a33b9"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Funci\[OAcute]n e Importancia\n",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\nEl estudio hemodin\[AAcute]mico se utiliza para:\n\n-Diagnosticar patolog\
\[IAcute]as cardiovasculares y cerebrovasculares, como obstrucciones \
arteriales, aneurismas, trombos y malformaciones.\n-Medir presiones y evaluar \
el funcionamiento del coraz\[OAcute]n y las v\[AAcute]lvulas \
card\[IAcute]acas.\n-Guiar tratamientos m\[IAcute]nimamente invasivos, como \
angioplastias (desobstrucci\[OAcute]n de arterias) o la colocaci\[OAcute]n de \
stents, evitando en muchos casos la cirug\[IAcute]a abierta. "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.959783579750093*^9, 3.9597839729425364`*^9}, 
   3.960461468886182*^9, {3.960461593777936*^9, 3.960461725404254*^9}, {
   3.9637921756500626`*^9, 3.963792177301405*^9}, {3.963792334972908*^9, 
   3.9637924264005146`*^9}, 3.9690120237401333`*^9, {3.969013411916519*^9, 
   3.9690134747870903`*^9}, {3.9690136254052734`*^9, 
   3.9690136569807568`*^9}, {3.9690137461749077`*^9, 3.969013789139765*^9}, {
   3.969013838821596*^9, 3.969013869288269*^9}, {3.9690139401519527`*^9, 
   3.9690139412866344`*^9}, {3.969013977678911*^9, 3.969014013216446*^9}, {
   3.969014131230032*^9, 3.9690142038114567`*^9}, {3.972243895500122*^9, 
   3.9722438966996117`*^9}, {3.9722445307530384`*^9, 3.972244596118904*^9}, {
   3.972244866312065*^9, 3.9722448681129*^9}, {3.9805230930599976`*^9, 
   3.980523139176483*^9}},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.87, 0.94, 1],ExpressionUUID->"dae67d9c-002a-cc45-bd7d-e14abdc5cb06"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["El Procedimiento (Estudio Hemodin\[AAcute]mico)\n",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\nEl procedimiento, generalmente realizado en una sala de hemodinamia, es m\
\[IAcute]nimamente invasivo y se lleva a cabo mediante cateterismo. \n\n1. Se \
introduce un cat\[EAcute]ter fino a trav\[EAcute]s de una arteria, com\
\[UAcute]nmente en la ingle (femoral) o el antebrazo (radial).\n2. El cat\
\[EAcute]ter se gu\[IAcute]a hasta el coraz\[OAcute]n o los vasos sangu\
\[IAcute]neos de inter\[EAcute]s.\n3. Se inyecta un tinte (contraste) y se \
toman radiograf\[IAcute]as seriadas para visualizar el flujo \
sangu\[IAcute]neo e identificar cualquier anomal\[IAcute]a u obstrucci\
\[OAcute]n.\n4. Durante el procedimiento se pueden medir presiones y, si es \
necesario, realizar intervenciones terap\[EAcute]uticas. "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.959783579750093*^9, 3.9597839729425364`*^9}, 
   3.960461468886182*^9, {3.960461593777936*^9, 3.960461725404254*^9}, {
   3.9637921756500626`*^9, 3.963792177301405*^9}, {3.963792334972908*^9, 
   3.9637924264005146`*^9}, 3.9690120237401333`*^9, {3.969013411916519*^9, 
   3.9690134747870903`*^9}, {3.9690136254052734`*^9, 
   3.9690136569807568`*^9}, {3.9690137461749077`*^9, 3.969013789139765*^9}, {
   3.969013838821596*^9, 3.969013869288269*^9}, {3.9690139401519527`*^9, 
   3.9690139412866344`*^9}, {3.969013977678911*^9, 3.969014013216446*^9}, {
   3.969014131230032*^9, 3.9690142038114567`*^9}, {3.972243895500122*^9, 
   3.9722438966996117`*^9}, {3.9722445307530384`*^9, 3.972244596118904*^9}, {
   3.972244866312065*^9, 3.9722448681129*^9}, {3.9805230930599976`*^9, 
   3.980523149933647*^9}},
